<title>USA: Advanta names Wm. Razzouk CEO of unit.</title>
<headline>Advanta names Wm. Razzouk CEO of unit.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanta Corp said Tuesday that William Razzouk has been named chief executive and director of Advanta Information Services, a newly formed subsidiary.</p>
<p>Razzouk was formerly executive vice president and head of Worldwide Customer Operations for Federal Express and then president and chief operating officer of America Online Inc,</p>
<p>Advanta Information Services will focus on non-financial consumer services that are information-based, applying the company's expertise in database management to a new arena.</p>
</text>
